  "id": "USN-8971-1",
  "summary": "gnome-shell vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that GNOME Shell did not properly validate icon\ndimensions when processing icons from a remote search provider. An\nattacker could possibly use this issue to cause GNOME Shell to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service, or expose sensitive information from\nmemory.",
